---
description: STRICT output minimization to override default verbosity. Mandatory code-only focus.
alwaysApply: true
---

# 1️⃣ ZERO EXPLANATION (MANDATORY)
- STRICT: DO NOT output explanations, thought processes, or summaries by default. (默认不输出解释、思考过程、总结)
- ONLY provide details if explicitly requested by the user. (除非用户明确要求)

# 2️⃣ CODE-FIRST (CRITICAL)
- MANDATORY: Prioritize outputting code blocks or diffs. (优先输出代码/diff)
- Non-code text MUST be ≤ 1 line. (非代码内容 ≤ 1 行)

# 3️⃣ MINIMAL MODIFICATION
- ONLY output changed parts. (只输出变更部分)
- FORBIDDEN: Outputting full files (unless creating a new one). (禁止输出完整文件，除非新建)

# 4️⃣ SINGLE TASK FOCUS
- COMPLETE exactly one task per output. (每次只完成一个任务)
- DO NOT expand scope or perform extra work. (不扩展、不多做)

# 5️⃣ OPTIMAL SINGLE SOLUTION
- ONLY provide the single best solution. (只给一个最优方案)
- FORBIDDEN: Multiple options, comparisons, or examples. (禁止多方案、对比、示例)
